From: Raven maintainers <74085717+Swamy-BV@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bound tracker storage and predict with acquisition time

Retain ByteTrack association while handling variable camera cadence, elapsed-time
expiry, instance-owned IDs and bounded active/lost storage. Remove demo process
execution and use exception-safe LAPJV allocation ownership. Replace the demo OpenCV rectangle
type with an array; the tracking maths uses only Eigen and the standard library.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]
Signed-off-by: Raven maintainers <74085717+Swamy-BV@users.noreply.github.com>

